{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":66.01575,"text":"This is the part of Jarvis I don't usually show. Hey Jarvis, can you go ahead and pull up Slack? Of course, sir. Now this is where the real work happens. See all these agents? Jarvis is the main operator. But then I have individual agents for different parts of the business. And because they are separate agents, I can have them working on different tasks at the same time. But they're not isolated from each other. See, Sarah is my customer support agent. If she sees a bug, she can go ahead and escalate it to the dev channel. Boom, where Tom can investigate the issue and ask me if it's something I want to implement. Once I give him the green light, he can go ahead and work through it and then gives me the pull request once it's done for me to review right there. And I also have channels for other parts of the business as well. You got ads, customer reviews and emails so I can quickly go through and see what's happening across everything. That's what makes AI feel like a real team working inside your business. The Jarvis UI is cool and all, but Slack is where work actually gets done.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.14451099872589113,"compression_ratio":1.6793650793650794,"end":2.7,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.02793930098414421,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" This is the part of Jarvis I don't usually show.","tokens":[50364,639,307,264,644,295,23941,4938,286,500,380,2673,855,13,50499],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.14451099872589113,"compression_ratio":1.6793650793650794,"end":5.3,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.02793930098414421,"seek":0,"start":2.7,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Hey Jarvis, can you go ahead and pull up Slack?","tokens":[50499,1911,23941,4938,11,393,291,352,2286,293,2235,493,37211,30,50629],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.14451099872589113,"compression_ratio":1.6793650793650794,"end":7.1,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.02793930098414421,"seek":0,"start":5.3,"temperature":0.0,"te